---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const authors = (await getCollection('authors')).filter((a) => a.data.active);
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Chintya is a publication about ideas worth thinking about — philosophy, economics, technology, culture, and the questions underneath them."
>
  <section class="container about-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow sans">About</p>
    <h1>A publication with no fixed subject</h1>
    <div class="prose about-prose">
      <p>
        चिंत्य — <em>chintya</em> — is a Hindi word for something worth
        pondering: not yet settled, still turning over in the mind. That's
        the only real editorial mandate here. We don't cover one beat. An
        essay on this site might sit next to a history of a failed
        institution, a close reading of a piece of technology, or a short
        argument about boredom.
      </p>
      <p>
        What holds it together is a way of writing, not a subject: essays
        that take one idea seriously enough to follow it somewhere specific,
        rather than gesture at everything at once. We publish slowly. There
        is no schedule to keep, no quota of posts per week — an essay goes
        up when it's ready, not before.
      </p>
      <p>
        Chintya publishes in both English and Hindi, on equal footing.
        Language here is a choice each writer makes for the piece they're
        writing, not a translation exercise performed after the fact.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule container" />

  <section class="container authors-section">
    <h2>Who writes here</h2>
    <div class="authors-grid">
      {authors.map((author) => (
        <a href={`/author/${author.id}/`} class="author-tile">
          <h3>{author.data.name}</h3>
          <p>{author.data.bio}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-5) var(--space-3);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.4vw, 3rem);
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-bottom: 0.8em;
  }

  .about-prose {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .authors-section {
    padding-block: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
  }

  .authors-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .authors-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .author-tile {
    display: block;
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    transition: border-color 0.25s var(--ease);
  }

  .author-tile:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .author-tile h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }

  .author-tile p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .authors-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
